menu "ESP Utils Configuration"

    config ESP_UTILS_LOG_MEM_FUNCTIONS
        bool "Log memory allocation functions"
        default n
        help
            Enable logging for memory allocation/deallocation via mem_helpers.
            When enabled, malloc, calloc, free, and strdup operations are logged
            with ESP_LOGI, showing size and pointer addresses.

            This is useful for debugging memory usage but adds overhead.

endmenu
